            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تماشاگران تیم را تشویق کردند. Tamâshâgarân tim râ tashviq kardand. The spectators cheered the team on."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also \"to encourage\": marâ be khândan tashviq kard. Present tashviq mikonad."
            }
          ]
        },
