          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "tashviq is usually traced to Arabic tashwīq, \"a stirring of desire, an encouragement\"; EtymDB lists no entry. kardan \"to do\" is inherited Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
